Arial',sans-serif;font-size:8pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%;padding-left:4.64pt"&gt;The fair value of the stock consideration is based on the December 15, 2025 closing price of ServiceNow common stock at $153.04 and approximately 9.6&#160;million shares of ServiceNow common stock.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</us-gaap:ScheduleOfBusinessAcquisitionsByAcquisitionTextBlock>
